#: socks.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>Galluoga'r modiwl yma i chi ffurfweddu cynhaliaeth KDE i weinydd SOCKS "
"neu ddirprwy.</p>"
"<p>Protocol yw SOCKS i groesi muriau cadarn, disgrifir yn <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"Os nad oes gennych syniad beth yw hwn ac os nad yw'ch rheolwr cysawd wedi "
"dweud wrthych am ei ddefnyddio, gadewch yn analluog."

#: socks.cpp:271
msgid "kcmsocks"
msgstr "kcmsocks"

#: socks.cpp:271
msgid "KDE SOCKS Control Module"
msgstr "Modiwl Rheoli SOCKS KDE"

