msgstr "(h)2001 George Staikos"

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:69
msgid ""
"Enter the site or domain name where a fake browser identity string should be "
"used. "
"<p><u>NOTE:</u> Wildcard syntaxes such as \"*,?\" are NOT allowed. Instead "
"enter the top level address of a site to make generic matches for all "
"locations found under it. For example, if you want all sites at "
"<code>http://www.acme.com</code> to receive a fake browser identification, "
"you would type in <code>.acme.com</code>."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch enw'r safwe neu'r parth lle dylid defnyddio llinyn ddynodiad porwr "
"ffug."
"<p><u>NODER:</u>Ni chaniateir cystrawen nôd-chwilio megis \"*,?\". Yn lle "
"hynny rhowch gyfeiriad lefel uchaf safwe i wneud cydweddiadau cyffredinol "
"oddi tano. Er enghraifft, os ydych am i bob safwe yn "
"<code>http://www.acme.com</code> i dderbyn dynodiad porwr ffug, fe deipiech "
"<code>.acme.com</code>."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:80
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"Select the browser-identification to use whenever contacting the site or "
"domain given above."
"<P>Upon selection, a straight forward description, if available, will be "
"displayed in the box below."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dewisch y dynodiad-porwr i'w ddefnyddio pan yn cysylltu â'r safwe neu "
"barth roddwyd uchod."
"<P>Wedi dewis, fe ddengys disgrifiad plaen, os oes un ar gael, yn y blwch "
"isod."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:87
msgid ""
"A non-technical (friendlier) description of the above browser identification "
"string."
msgstr "Disgrifiad anhechnegol (mwy cyfeillgar) o'r llinyn ddynodi porwr uchod."

#: uagentproviderdlg.cpp:93
msgid ""
"Updates the browser identification list.<p>\n"
"<u>NOTE:</u> There is no need to press this button unless a new description "
"file was added while this configuration box is displayed!"
msgstr ""
"Diweddara'r restr dynodiadau porwyr<p>\n"
"<u>NODER:</u> Nid oes angen gwasgu'r botwm yma os na ychwanegwyd ffeil "
"ddisgrifiad newydd tra y dengys y blwch ffurfweddu yma!"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<qt>Enable/disable the sending of the browser identification while browsing "
"sites."
"<P><u>NOTE:</u> Many sites rely on this information to display pages "
"properly, hence, it is highly recommended that you do not totally disable "
"this feature but rather customize it."
"<P>By default only minimal identification information is sent to remote "
"sites. You can see this string below.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Galluogi/analluogi anfon y dynodiad porwr tra'n pori "
"safweoedd."
"<P><u>NODER:</u> Dibynna llawer safwe ar y wybodaeth hyn i ddangos "
"tudalennau'n gywir, felly, rydym yn argymell yn gryf iawn na'ch bod chi ddim "
"yn analluogi'r nodwedd yma'n gyfangwbl, ond ei addasu."
"<P>Yn rhagosod dim ond dynodiad lleiaf a anfonir i safweoedd pell. Gallwch "
"weld y llinyn isod.</qt>"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:68
msgid ""
"Check any one of the following boxes to modify the level of information that "
"should be included in the default browser identification in <b>bold</b>."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch unrhyw un o'r blychau canlynol i addasu lefel y wybodaeth a ddylid "
"cynnwys yn y dynodiad porwr rhagosodedig <b>bras</b>."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:74
msgid ""
"The default identification sent to remote sites during browsing. You can "
"customize it using the options provided below."
msgstr ""
"Y llinyn ddynodiad ragosodedig i'w anfon i safweoedd pell tra'n pori. "
"Gallwch ei addasu gan ddefnyddio'r dewisiadau a ddarperir isod."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:79
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>operating system name</code>"
" to the default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y blwch yma i ychwanegu <code>enw eich cysawd weithredu</code> i'r "
"llinyn ddynodiad ragosodedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>operating system version number</code> to "
"the default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y blwch yma i ychwanegu <code>rhif fersiwn eich cysawd "
"weithredu</code> i'r llinyn ddynodiad ragosodedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>platform</code> to the default "
"identification string."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y blwch yma i ychwanegu eich <code>platfform</code> i'r llinyn "
"ddynodiad ragosodedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:91
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your <code>machine or processor type</code> to the "
"default identification string."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y blwch yma i ychwanegu eich <code>math peiriant neu "
"brosesydd</code> i'r llinyn ddynodiad ragosodedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:95
msgid ""
"Check this box to add your language settings to the default identification "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch y blwch yma i ychwanegu eich gosodiadau iaith i'r llinyn ddynodiad "
"ragosodedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:99
msgid "Site/Domain Name"
msgstr "Enw Safwe/Parth"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:100
msgid "User Agent"
msgstr "Asiant Defnyddiwr"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:101
msgid "Alias"
msgstr "Ffugenw"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:107
msgid ""
"Browser identification strings that will be used in place of the default one "
"above whenever you browse the listed site or sites."
msgstr ""
"Llinynnau dynodi porwyr y defnyddir yn lle'r un ragosodedig uchod pan "
"fyddwch yn pori'r safwe(oedd) r(h)estredig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:112
msgid "Add browser identification for a specific site."
msgstr "Ychwanegu dynodiad porwr i safwe penodol."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:113
msgid "Change the selected identifier."
msgstr "Newid y dynodiad dewisiedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:114
msgid "Delete the selected identifier."
msgstr "Dileu'r dynodiad dewisiedig."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:115
msgid "Delete all identifiers"
msgstr "Dileu pob dynodiad"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:117
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"Here you can modify the default browser-identification string and/or set a "
"site <code>(ex:www.kde.org)</code> or a domain <code>(ex:kde.org)</code> "
"specific identification."
"<P>To add a new agent string, simply click on the <code>New </code>button "
"and supply the necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change "
"an existing site specific entry, click on the <code>Change</code> button. "
"The <code>Delete </code>"
" button will remove the selected policy, causing the default setting to be "
"used for that site or domain."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Yma gallwch addasu'r llinyn ddynodi-porwr rhagosodedig a/neu gosod "
"dynodiad penodol i safwe <code>(ee:www.kde.org)</code> neu barth "
"<code>(ee:kde.org)</code>"
"<P>I ychwanegu llinyn asiant newydd, cliciwch ar y botwm <code>Newydd</code>"
" a rhow y wybodaeth angenrheidiol a ofynnir amdano gan y blwch ymgom. I "
"newid cofnod cyfredol ar gyfer safwe penodol, cliciwch ar y botwm "
"<code>Newid</code>. Bydd y botwm <code>Dileu</code> yn gwaredu'r polisi "
"dewisiedig, gan achosi defnyddio'r gosodiad rhagosodedig ar gyfer y safwe "
"neu barth yna."

#: useragentdlg.cpp:297
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<center>Found an existing identification for"
"<br/><b>%1</b><br/>Do you want to replace it?</center></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<center>Canfuwyd dynodiad cyfredol ar gyfer"
"<br/><b>%1</b><br/>A ydych am ei amnewid?</center></qt>"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:302
msgid "Duplicate Identification"
msgstr "Dynodiad Dyblyg"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:320
msgid "Add Identification"
msgstr "Ychwanegu Dynodiad"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:339
msgid "Modify Identification"
msgstr "Addasu Dynodiad"

#: useragentdlg.cpp:444
msgid ""
"<h1>Browser Identification</h1>"
" The browser-identification module allows you to have full control over how "
"Konqueror will identify itself to web sites you browse."
"<P>This ability to fake identification is necessary because some web sites "
"do not display properly when they detect that they are not talking to "
"current versions of either Netscape Navigator or Internet Explorer, even if "
"the browser actually supports all the necessary features to render those "
"pages properly. For such sites, you can use this feature to try to browse "
"them. Please understand that this might not always work, since such sites "
"might be using non-standard web protocols and or "
"specifications."
"<P><u>NOTE:</u> To obtain specific help on a particular section of the "
"dialog box, simply click on the little <b>?</b> button on the top right "
"corner of the window, then click on the section for which you are seeking "
"help."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Dynodiad Porwr</h1>"
" Galluoga'r modwl dynodiad-porwr i chi rheoli'n llawn sut y dynoda Konqueror "
"ei hunan i safweoedd y porwch."
"<P>Mae'r gallu yma i ffugio dynodiad yn angenrheidiol oherwydd nad yw rhai "
"safweoedd yn ymddangos yn gywir pan eu bod yn canfod nad ydynt yn siarad â "
"fersiwn cyfredol o naill ai Gwê-lywiwr Netscape neu Internet Explorer, hyd "
"yn oed os yw'r porwr yn cynnal yr holl nodweddion angenrheidiol i lunio'r "
"tudalennau hynny'n gywir. Ar gyfer safweoedd o'r fath, gallwch ddefnyddio'r "
"nodwedd yma i geisio'u pori. Ceisiwch ddeall, os gwelwch yn dda, efallai na "
"wnaiff hyn weithio bob tro, gan gall fod y fath safweoedd yn defnydio "
"protocolau gwê neu benodiadau ansafonol."
"<P><u>NODER:</u> I ganfod cymorth penodol ar gyfer adran penodol o'r blwch "
"ymgom, cliciwch ar y botwm bach <b>?</b>"
" ar gornel pen-dde'r ffenestr, wedyn cliciwch ar yr adran yr hoffech gymorth "
"arni. "

